    (at 63.5 37.7 90)
    (descr "Raspberry Pi Pico / Pico 2 module, castellated SMD pads (40 + 3 debug) + USB test points TP1/TP2/TP3 per Pico 2 datasheet Fig.5. USB connector at -Y (top). -- SHORT PADS: main-board pads end 0.4 mm outside the module (instead of 1.0) so the module can sit close to the card-edge shoulder and shell ribs (rev F2).")
